on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pushcons 0 .............................. <"Ber07b">
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, "Ber07b">
  [  7] extcall 37 .............................. puppetSound(1, "Ber07b")
  [ 10] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 13] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 15] pushint8 900 ............................ <900>
  [ 18] add ..................................... <the timer + 900>
  [ 19] setglobal 54 ............................ FindusTimer = the timer + 900
  [ 22] ret
end
